This product includes a character n-gram model (src/harfix/data/arabic_char_lm.json.gz)
whose letter statistics were derived from the following datasets, both licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:

- Misraj/Misraj-DocOCR, revision 7177bf70f77ce259890d6af0bef53f18faf26ec9
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/Misraj/Misraj-DocOCR
- Misraj/KITAB_pdf_to_markdown_reviewed, revision 8890d721c660cd027839bc8bc48634552fe7aec6
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/Misraj/KITAB_pdf_to_markdown_reviewed

No text from these datasets is distributed with harfix; only aggregate character counts.

The font maps (src/harfix/data/font_maps.json.gz) hold glyph-to-letter probabilities
learned by aligning PDF glyphs with typed editions published on al-Maktaba al-Shamela
(https://shamela.ws). They contain no text, only per-glyph output probabilities.
